			"notes": "Early alpha version built for test purposes. Includes alot of new blocks, tools, foods and even mobs.\nAlso included a test world in the files to see all the newly added features yourself :)\n\n## What's Changed\n* Datagen implemented by @termilu in https://github.com/termilu/terMc-1.21.X/pull/4\n* Added various non-block blocks by @termilu in https://github.com/termilu/terMc-1.21.X/pull/5\n* Added custom tools by @termilu in https://github.com/termilu/terMc-1.21.X/pull/6\n* Custom tools by @termilu in https://github.com/termilu/terMc-1.21.X/pull/7\n* Added new Torches by @termilu in https://github.com/termilu/terMc-1.21.X/pull/8\n* Added custom mobs by @termilu in https://github.com/termilu/terMc-1.21.X/pull/9\n* Added Mango. by @termilu in https://github.com/termilu/terMc-1.21.X/pull/10\n* Added natural mob spawning for custom mobs. by @termilu in https://github.com/termilu/terMc-1.21.X/pull/12\n* Added custom Capybara Sfx + Dodo Sfx. by @termilu in https://github.com/termilu/terMc-1.21.X/pull/13\n* Added chisel item. by @termilu in https://github.com/termilu/terMc-1.21.X/pull/14\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/termilu/terMc-1.21.X/compare/v0.1.0-alpha...v0.7.5-alpha"
